# checks - px32's test tune (tests/mpx3-orchestra, checks.spec): two parts
# with independent rhythms and their own pitches, then a crescendo and a
# diminuendo on one held note. The trumpet's notes lie above the flute's
# low ones, so no strong harmonic of one part sits near a fundamental of
# the other while both sound.
title px32 checks
tempo 120
part hi trumpet mf pan -50
part lo flute mf pan 50
part sw flute pp
bar 1
hi  C5/4 D#5/4 F#5/4 A5/4
lo  G2/4. D3/4. A3/4
bar 2
sw  pp < Bb4/1~
bar 3
sw  Bb4/1 ff
bar 4
sw  > E5/1~
bar 5
sw  E5/1 pp
